draw((10.5,7.5)--(13.5,7.5),Arrow);

[/asy]

A right pyramid has a square base that measures X cm on each side. Its peak is 12 cm above the center of its base. What is the sum of the lengths of the pyramid's eight edges? Express your answer to the nearest whole number.

